.TH UNROT 1 "October 2026" "unrot 0.3.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
unrot \- daily practice app based on "How to Unrot Your Brain"
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B unrot
[\fB\-\-background\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Opens a window with five daily steps, a weekly view, a journal,
a reading and research list, and ideas from the book.
With \fB\-\-background\fR it starts hidden and only runs reminders and timers.
Data is stored in $XDG_DATA_HOME/unrot/unrot.db
(by default ~/.local/share/unrot/unrot.db).
